# The legal pages RENDER these two files (`?raw` import) instead of holding a second copy of the
# text — so they are build inputs, not documentation. Without the re-include the app builds fine
# outside Docker and the image build fails at `pnpm build` with ENOENT.
# `tests/legalPages.test.ts` derives the required list from the pages themselves and fails if a
# page imports a document that is not re-included here.
!docs/eula.md
!docs/privacy-policy.md
!docs/site-terms.md
!docs/site-privacy.md
